---
layout: compress
swcache: true
---

{% comment %}
  Local override of jekyll-theme-chirpy 7.6.0's `assets/js/data/search.json`,
  identical to the upstream file except that the `categories` field is removed —
  this site has no category taxonomy. Paired with the `_includes/search-loader.html`
  override, which stops reading it.

  Re-check both against upstream when the Chirpy version in Gemfile changes.
{% endcomment %}

[
  {% for post in site.posts %}
  {
    "title": {{ post.title | jsonify }},
    "url": {{ post.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
    "tags": {{ post.tags | join: ', ' | jsonify }},
    "date": {{ post.date | jsonify }},
    {% capture content -%}{% include post-summary.html full_text=true %}{%- endcapture -%}
    "content": {{ content | jsonify }}
  }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
]
